        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    equity_proportion = 0.20\n    debt_proportion = 0.80\n    cost_of_equity = 0.10\n    pretax_cost_of_debt = 0.05\n    tax_rate = 0.21\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    after_tax_cost_of_debt = pretax_cost_of_debt * (1 - tax_rate)\n    wacc = (\n        equity_proportion * cost_of_equity\n        + debt_proportion * after_tax_cost_of_debt\n    )\n    answer = round(wacc * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
